ExLlamaV3 EXL3 codec

The vllm_sm80 plugin's EXL3 kernels adapt ExLlamaV3's matrix trellis packing,
procedural codebooks, tensor-core lane ordering and Hadamard conventions
(quant/pack.cu, quant/frac.cu, quant/codebook.cuh, quant/exl3_dq.cuh,
quant/hadamard_inner.cuh, modules/quant/exl3_lib/quantize.py) in
csrc/exl3/codec.cuh, csrc/exl3/moe_v2_try/codec.cuh, csrc/exl3/reference.cu
and the csrc/exl3/ kernels that include the codec, and its compressed n-gram
ring mapping and mul1 constants (modules/quant/exl3_lib/ngram_codec.py) in
csrc/exl3/ple.cu. The plugin also carries this notice in licenses/exl3/. This
notice applies to that third-party portion; it does not replace other
component licence notices.
