DeepSeekv41-Flash-EXL3-TC-MoE tensor-core MoE shape

The vllm_sm80 plugin's EXL3 tensor-core MoE (csrc/exl3/moe_v2.cu and
csrc/exl3/moe_v2_try.cu) adapts Curtis White's hidden-5120 lane shape: two
H128 blocks per gate/up input warp, column groups of four n16 tiles, and lane
kernels per bit width. Splitting each routed expert across the cards follows
an idea of the same work. This notice applies to that third-party portion; it
does not replace other component licence notices.
